        <mxCell id="card-where" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4f46e5&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;I want to change… → commit in&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;My app&amp;#39;s code, tests, Dockerfile, CI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → applications/&amp;lt;app&amp;gt; (app team).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;My app&amp;#39;s image tag, env vars, replicas in staging&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → platform/app-configs, apps/&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;/values-staging.yaml (app team MR). Prod values need platform approval (CODEOWNERS).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Security settings, probes, secrets list, route, allowed groups&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → platform/infra, gitops/apps/&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;/ (platform team). The baseline loads last and wins.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;A new secret value&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → Vault, via the platform team. Never in Git.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;A CI job for everyone&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → devops/ci-cd-templates. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;A new app&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → start from devops/app-templates.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;What the chart renders for every app&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → platform/generic-app-chart. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;A base image&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → platform/base-images.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;BI connectors, pipelines, dashboards&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → bi/&amp;lt;tool&amp;gt;.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Someone&amp;#39;s GitLab access or a new repo&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → platform/gitlab-provisioning. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;VMs, network, security groups&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → platform/openstack-provisioning.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Platform docs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → platform/platform-docs. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Cross-team standards, ADRs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; → urbaniste/architecture-docs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="2040" width="1180" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0891b2&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;From commit to cluster&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; The app team pushes to applications/&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; Its pipeline (ci-cd-templates) builds and pushes a vX.Y.Z-rc.N image.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; Image Updater sees the new tag and commits it to app-configs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD pulls app-configs, generic-app-chart and infra, renders the app and applies it.&lt;br&gt;• Stacked boxes: one repo per app or per tool, same shape.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1760" y="2040" width="640" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps between docs and code&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Apps.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; flight-tracking has a repo but no Argo CD Application. app-sandbox exists but is not in the docs tree.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Products.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; clock-service, actors-simulator and platform-sdk repos exist. Nothing from them is deployed.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Docs tree&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (gitlab-structure.md) misses app-configs, bi/, urbaniste/ and the members role group.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2420" y="2040" width="540" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
